Whitney Hodges: like you said, there's not much that you really need to do to… to change it or tweak it, right? Like, you kind of just let the algorithm work. Where the real work oftentimes comes in is if, um, you know, you launch a campaign and you're not seeing amazing results right off the bat. It's a…

00:23:05.000 --> 00:23:06.000
